sequenceDiagram
  participant U as User / App (Account A 1111)
  participant STS as AWS STS
  participant R as IAM Role (Account B 2222)
  participant S3 as S3 Bucket (Account B)
  U->>STS: sts:AssumeRole(RoleArn, ExternalId)
  STS->>R: Check Trust Policy: is Account A allowed?
  R-->>STS: Yes
  STS-->>U: Temporary credentials (AccessKey, Secret, SessionToken, 1h)
  U->>S3: GetObject using temporary credentials
  S3-->>U: Object (allowed by role permission policy)
